    "updated_at": "2021-10-09T06:05:30Z",
    "body": "I think the note is still applicable. It depends the type of rendering context. if `offscreenCanvas` has a 2d rendering context, then `contextlost` event follows the spec I added. If the `offscreenCanvas` has a `webgl` context, it follows webgl spec.  \r\n\r\n@kenrussell: Could you provide your insights on the webgl parts? Thank you!",
