    "updated_at": "2021-10-20T06:01:24Z",
    "body": "Another thing that needs updating per blink-dev: these events should only be fired when the corresponding top-level browsing context has focus/visibility. This will make aligning with the WebGL events more important.\r\n\r\nFiled https://github.com/KhronosGroup/WebGL/issues/3349 on event handler attributes in WebGL.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
